= Chicago Medical School at Rosalind Franklin University of Medicine and Science - Prompt 02

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Challenge or Setback
- Limit: 150 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2025-2026 from Med School Insiders
- Source: https://medschoolinsiders.com/medical-school-secondary-prompts-database/chicago-med-school-rosalind-franklin-secondary-essay-prompts/
- Local notes file: prompt-02.local.md

#section_label("Prompt text")
Tell us about a time when you faced a significant challenge or setback. How did you navigate it, and what did you learn from the experience that will help you succeed in medical school?

#section_label("Shared backbone files")
- typst/shared/challenge.typ

#section_label("challenge backbone")
= Challenge / Adversity Backbone

== Situation
Describe the challenge clearly and briefly.

== Response
- What did you do?
- What tradeoffs or hard decisions did you make?
- Who did you rely on?

== Growth
- What changed in you?
- How will this matter in medicine?

